<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Orange Egypt | Confirmation</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@500;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root{
  --orange:#ff7900;
  --black:#000;
  --white:#fff;
}

*{ box-sizing:border-box; }

body{
  margin:0;
  background:#ffffff;
  font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;
}

/* HEADER */

.home-header{
  background:#000;
  height:64px;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
}

.home-header__inner{
  max-width:1400px;
  width:100%;
  margin:auto;
  padding:0 40px;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:center;
}

.brand img{ height:36px; }

/* MAIN SECTION */

.confirm-section{
  padding:120px 20px;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
}

.confirm-card{
  width:100%;
  max-width:700px;
  background:#fff;
  border-radius:16px;
  box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
  padding:60px 50px;
  text-align:center;
  position:relative;
}

.confirm-card::before{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;
  top:0;
  right:0;
  left:0;
  height:6px;
  background:var(--orange);
  border-radius:16px 16px 0 0;
}

.confirm-icon{
  font-size:60px;
  color:var(--orange);
  margin-bottom:25px;
}

.confirm-title{
  font-size:28px;
  font-weight:900;
  margin-bottom:20px;
}

.confirm-text{
  font-size:16px;
  line-height:1.8;
  color:#444;
  margin-bottom:40px;
}

.button-group{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  gap:20px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.main-btn{
  padding:14px 28px;
  border:none;
  border-radius:8px;
  font-weight:800;
  font-size:14px;
  cursor:pointer;
  text-decoration:none;
  transition:.3s;
}

.orange-btn{
  background:var(--orange);
  color:#000;
}

.orange-btn:hover{
  background:#e56d00;
}

.black-btn{
  background:#000;
  color:#fff;
}

.black-btn:hover{
  background:#222;
}

/* FOOTER */

.footer{
  background:#000;
  padding:70px 0;
  border-top:1px solid #222;
  margin-top:80px;
}

.footer-inner{
  max-width:1400px;
  margin:auto;
  padding:0 40px;
  display:flex;
  gap:120px;
  direction:ltr;
}

.footer-column{
  flex:1;
}

.footer-column h4{
  color:#fff;
  font-size:18px;
  font-weight:700;
  margin-bottom:25px;
}

.footer-column a{
  display:block;
  color:#fff;
  text-decoration:none;
  font-size:14px;
  margin-bottom:14px;
  transition:.2s;
}

.footer-column a:hover{
  color:var(--orange);
}

@media(max-width:768px){
  .footer-inner{
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:40px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header class="home-header">
  <div class="home-header__inner">
    <a class="brand" href="/">
      <img src="https://i.ibb.co/RTFb3J9D/Orange-Egypt-Logo-wine.png">
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="confirm-section">
  <div class="confirm-card">

    <div class="confirm-icon">✔</div>

    <div class="confirm-title">
      تم استلام طلبك بنجاح 🎉
    </div>

    <div class="confirm-text">
      شكرًا لك <strong><%= user.first_name %></strong> على التقديم.<br>
      فريق Orange سيقوم بمراجعة طلبك بعناية،<br>
      وفي حالة القبول سيتم التواصل معك قريبًا.
    </div>

    <div class="button-group">
      <a href="/" class="main-btn orange-btn">العودة للصفحة الرئيسية</a>
      <a href="/logout" class="main-btn black-btn">تسجيل الخروج</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">

    <div class="footer-column">
      <h4>Business</h4>
      <a href="#">Business plans</a>
      <a href="#">Business solutions</a>
      <a href="#">SPECIAL for Business</a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-column">
      <h4>Shop</h4>
      <a href="#">Offers and promotions</a>
      <a href="#">Internet</a>
      <a href="#">Services</a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-column">
      <h4>Quick Links</h4>
      <a href="#">About Orange Egypt</a>
      <a href="#">Investor relations</a>
      <a href="#">Help</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

</body>
</html>
